      "content": "Actually, i've got a rough outline of my research goals already, but it feels a bit too \"plain English\" right now. i'm worried it won't trigger the filter. \n\ncan you try taking these points and turning them into a sophisticated opening paragraph? i want it to sound like someone who really understands the deep theoretical implications of my work. just try to weave those terms in wherever they make sense for the flow.\n\nhere's the gist: i study how AI algorithms affect social structures. i use both data and interviews to show that bias isn't just a bug but is built into the system. i want to create better ways to fix these issues.",
